<rml><head><title>JFG Live Map</title><link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="live-tools.rcss"/></head>
<body class="live-map">
<div class="menu" id="tool-menu"><button id="tool-view">View</button><button id="tool-settings">Settings</button><button id="tool-tools">Tools</button></div>
<div id="map-area"><map-scene id="map-scene"/><div id="marker-labels"/>
 <div id="waiting-room"><div class="waiting-copy"><div class="waiting-title">Waiting for a loaded room</div><p>The map draws itself as soon as gameplay starts and room geometry loads.</p><div class="readiness"><div id="connection-state">No game running</div><div id="gameplay-state">Start a game from the launcher</div><div class="pending">Room geometry</div><div class="pending">Progression data</div></div></div></div>
 <div id="map-legend"><div><span class="legend-player"><i class="legend-symbol filled"/><span>Player</span></span><span class="legend-exit"><i class="legend-symbol"/><span>Exits</span></span><span class="legend-item"><i class="legend-symbol square"/><span>Items</span></span><span class="legend-enemy"><i class="legend-symbol diamond filled"/><span>Enemies</span></span></div><div><span class="legend-npc"><i class="legend-symbol diamond filled"/><span>NPCs</span></span><span class="legend-tribal"><i class="legend-symbol diamond filled"/><span>Tribals</span></span><span class="legend-door"><i class="legend-symbol square"/><span>Doors</span></span></div></div>
 <div id="zoom-controls"><button id="zoom-minus" title="Zoom out"><span>−</span></button><span id="zoom-level">100%</span><button id="zoom-plus" title="Zoom in"><span>+</span></button><button id="zoom-fit" title="Fit room"><span>Fit</span></button></div>
</div>
<div id="inspector-collapsed"><button id="show-inspector" aria-label="Show inspector" aria-expanded="false"><span>‹</span></button><span>INSPECTOR</span></div><div id="map-inspector"><div class="inspector-heading"><span class="section-label">INSPECTOR</span><button id="hide-inspector" aria-label="Hide inspector" aria-expanded="true"><span>›</span></button></div><select id="interaction-filter"><option value="0">All interactions</option><option value="1">Chests</option><option value="2">Pickups</option><option value="3">Exits</option><option value="4">Characters</option><option value="5">Enemies</option></select><div class="progress-card"><span>Progression</span><div id="progress-value">Not loaded yet</div></div><div id="interaction-list"/><div id="interaction-details">Nothing to inspect yet. Once a room loads, select anything on the map to see its reward, requirements and coordinates.</div><button id="center-selected" disabled>Center selected</button></div>
<div class="tool-footer"><span id="tool-status">Connecting to live tools...</span><span class="tool-hint">Wheel zoom · Drag pan</span></div>
<div id="view-popup" class="game-popup"><button id="fit-room">Fit room <span class="shortcut">Ctrl+0</span></button><div class="separator"/><button id="view-inspector">Inspector</button><button id="view-legend">Legend</button><button id="view-labels" role="menuitemcheckbox" aria-checked="false">All object labels<span class="menu-check"/></button></div>
<div id="settings-popup" class="game-popup"><button id="map-settings">Map settings…</button></div>
<div id="tools-popup" class="game-popup"><button id="open-inventory">Open inventory screen</button><button id="open-exports">Open exports folder</button></div>
<div id="tool-modal"><div class="live-settings"><div class="settings-header"><span class="amber-dot"/><span>LIVE MAP SETTINGS</span><button id="settings-close" title="Close"><span>×</span></button></div><div class="settings-main"><div class="settings-tabs"><button id="tab-display" class="selected">Display</button><button id="tab-ai">AI</button><button id="tab-mods">Mods</button></div><div id="settings-content"/></div><div class="settings-footer"><button id="restore-defaults">Restore defaults</button><button id="settings-done" class="primary"><span>Done</span></button></div></div></div>
<div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="notice-dot"/><span id="toast-text"/></div>
</body></rml>
